---
layout: base.njk
title: Engineering analysis archive
description: A collection of deep dives into software engineering, architecture, and production post-mortems.
permalink: /articles/
---

<header class="mb-16">
  <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold tracking-tight text-black mb-4">
    Engineering analysis archive
  </h1>
  <p class="text-xl text-gray-500 max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
    Deep dives into software engineering, architecture, and production post-mortems.
  </p>
</header>

<nav class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-2.5 mb-12" aria-label="Topics">
  <span class="text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest">Topics</span>
  {%- for slug, topic in topics %}
  <a href="/topics/{{ slug }}/" class="inline-flex items-center px-2 py-0.5 rounded text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider bg-gray-50 text-gray-600 border border-gray-200 hover:border-gray-400 hover:text-black transition-colors">
    {{ topic.name }} ({{ collections[slug].length or 0 }})
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</nav>

<section class="mb-24">
  {%- for post in collections.post | reverse -%}
  {% include "post-card.njk" %}
  {%- endfor -%}
</section>
